 to know something

01:03:32.450 --> 01:03:36.929
which John might not tell
 you. When we opened up
 the Media Lab in 1985,

01:03:36.930 --> 01:03:40.819
one of the less
 colorful groups was an
 advanced television program,

01:03:40.820 --> 01:03:43.839
which was a
 very engineering approach
 to high definition

01:03:43.840 --> 01:03:48.189
and stuff like
