 electrical engineering
 named John Maeda

01:03:51.150 --> 01:03:57.069
who was awfully
 unhappy with his 6'2"
 Germanic heel clicking advisor.

01:03:57.070 --> 01:04:00.459
And he says, oh, I'm
 so unhappy. And I really
 want to be an artist.

01:04:00.460 --> 01:04:04.739
And for one reason
 or another, he drops out.
 He goes to Japan.

01:04:04.740 --> 01:04:08.299
I think his parents
 may have blamed me or
 other people. But they

01:04:08.300 --> 01:04:15.349
weren't happy. And John
 goes to Japan, end of
 story Nine years later,

01:04:15.350 --> 01:04:23.119
Muriel dies 1994, May
 28th And after recovering,
 which you can't

01:04:23.120 --> 01:04:30.389
really do very easily, we
 set up a search, an
 international search, for who

01:04:30.390 --> 01:04:34.529
could replace Muriel Cooper.
 Well, the answer is
 nobody can replace

01:04:34.530 --> 01:04:39.909
Muriel Cooper. But who
 could we get that would
 be somewhat in the

01:04:39.910 --> 01:04:44.449
same domain? And this was
 not a fixed, wired search.
 This was a real,

01:04:44.450 --> 01:04:51.759
honest global search. And
 boop, John Maeda appears
 from Japan and

01:04:51.760 --> 01:04:56.129
applies, comes here, gives
 the talk and won
 that search handsdown.

01:04:56.130 --> 01:04:59.799
And came back as
 a faculty member, which I'm
 sure his parents also

01:04:59.800 --> 01:05:04.609
loved us for
 now that you are
 back So John?

01:05:04.610 --> 01:05:09.769
 (Applause).

01:05:09.770 --> 01:05:13.519
&gt;&gt; Thank you.
 Wow, that was
 a nice introduction.

01:05:13.520 --> 01:05:15.239
 (Chuckles).

