video. Oh, video problem. Oh,
 no problem Okay. So, first
 of all, I want to

01:06:30.720 --> 01:06:38.659
know something that Ben
 Fry didn't mention. Where is
 Ben? Ben is over

01:06:38.660 --> 01:06:44.209
there. Thank you. Press play.
 It will come. Ben, where
 are you, Ben? Ben,

01:06:44.210 --> 01:06:49.819
you're back there. So I
 arrived here at the Media Lab
 And I had to like

